{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"图的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-definitions-representations","title":"图的定义与表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/graph-definitions-representations","wordCount":2259,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"degree-handshaking-theorem","title":"度数与握手定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/degree-handshaking-theorem","wordCount":2372,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"paths-connectivity","title":"路径、连通性与图的结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/paths-connectivity","wordCount":2398,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"图的基础-简介\">图的基础 简介</h1><p>本章建立图论学习的概念基石，从图的数学定义到存储实现，从度数理论到连通性分析，系统构建理解后续算法和应用所需的完整术语体系与思维框架。</p>\n<p><strong>图的定义与表示</strong> 给出图的形式化定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，区分有向图、无向图、简单图、多重图和加权图等基本类型，并详细讨论邻接矩阵、邻接表、关联矩阵三种核心存储结构的空间复杂度与适用场景，帮助读者在理论描述和工程实现之间建立桥梁。</p>\n<p><strong>度数与握手定理</strong> 围绕顶点度数这一基本不变量展开，证明握手定理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{v \\in V} d(v) = 2|E|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 及其推论，讨论度数序列的可图化判定（Erdős–Gallai 定理），并引入有向图中入度与出度的概念，展示度数分析在网络科学中的实际意义。</p>\n<p><strong>路径、连通性与图的结构</strong> 定义路径、回路、连通分量等概念，讨论割点、桥和块的结构意义，介绍 Tarjan 算法求强连通分量的基本思路，为后续最短路径和网络流算法奠定结构性基础。</p>\n<p>学习建议：本章内容偏重定义和基本性质，建议配合手动画图练习加深理解。每个概念都会在后续章节中反复使用，务必确保对符号体系和基本定理的熟练掌握。</p>\n"}